    "Support outcomes are controlled generated fixture inputs, not observed business trials.",
    "Read-only grading is separate code inside one trusted process. Opaque explicit IDs remove literal label leakage; they do not create a security boundary against a malicious controller with access to the driver, runtime or filesystem.",
